cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "QUADRIGA scaffolding"
abstract: >-
  scaffold keeps the shared files of a QUADRIGA Open Educational Resource (OER)
  in sync with the versions packaged here. It compares an OER created from the
  QUADRIGA Book_Template against the metadata scripts, the shared CSS and
  JavaScript, the Sphinx extensions and the GitHub Actions that ship with this
  package, reports the drift and, with --update, installs the current files and
  removes retired ones. Book-specific files such as _config.yml, _toc.yml,
  chapters and notebooks are never touched.
type: software
authors:
